1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,910
Hey guys, here's your psychology tip of the day.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:08,750
If you are a deeply loving, deeply feeling, deeply caring person,

3
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:14,930
you are a gem in a harsh, cruel world.

4
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:19,310
And you will be disappointed because not everyone loves like you.

5
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,810
So what do you do about that?

6
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,550
You take care of yourself.

7
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,230
You love yourself.

8
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:29,310
You fill up your own cup and you protect yourself

9
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:33,430
and you have standards so you don't have users and abusers around you

10
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:37,130
trying to take what they can't reciprocate.

11
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:38,930
Take care of you.

12
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:40,110
You're a gem.

